      },
      "message": "fix(c-axis): support -Z C rotary sense and arcs in stamp_c (slice 3)\n\nSupport clockwise C rotary axes (\"axis\": [0, 0, -1]) across machine\nchecks, the rotary gate, Fanuc lathe posting, and setup sheets while\nrefusing non-finite or non-Z C vectors by name. Subdivide arcs in\ncl::stamp_c via Move::segments3(tol * 0.5) so curved C-turn moves stay\nwithin tolerance instead of being rejected. Add end-to-end World gate,\nposting, and setup sheet integration tests in c_axis_live_world.\n\nRefs #33",
